  "contrast_note": "The light stroke carries the mark on #0f1b24 and the topo tones (>=3.94:1). On light pages the #2b1d0e casing is the visible edge (>=14.8:1) and the light stroke is the inner line.",
  "label": "\"<agreement name> <year>\" + cite (source_id and pages from the event row), e.g. \"Juba Peace Agreement 2020 · UNSC2559 p.2\"; Arabic from the event ar field with its VERIFY chip when tagged",
